-camp-car/","src":[["https://mountainrailwv.com/train-rides/cass-camp-car/","Mountain Rail WV: Cass Camp Car (official site)"]],"sub":"train","loc":"approx","note":"Pinned at Cass, where the steam train leaves; the car sits on a siding 1.7 miles up the line."}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-81.098237,38.042846]},"properties":{"id":"red-caboose-fayetteville","n":"Red Caboose Vacation Rentals (C&O and NYC cabooses)","k":"rail","town":"Fayetteville","cty":"Fayette","why":"Two vintage cabooses, a Chesapeake & Ohio and a New York Central, made into cabins with cupola sleeping lofts near the New River Gorge Bridge.","web":"https://www.redcabooserentals.com/","src":[["https://www.redcabooserentals.com/cantrellstation","Red Caboose: the C&O Caboose (official site)"],["https://www.redcabooserentals.com/nyc","Red Caboose: the NYC Caboose (official site)"]],"sub":"caboose","loc":"approx","note":"Pinned at Cantrell Ultimate Rafting (49 Cantrell Dr.); the site says the cabooses are right next door."}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-81.130076,37.751716]},"properties":{"id":"pine-haven-treehouses","n":"Treehouses at Cabins at Pine Haven","k":"rail","town":"Beaver","cty":"Raleigh","why":"Treehouses in the woods near Beckley, each with its own hot tub and a nature-watching back deck.","web":"https://cabinsatpinehaven.com/treehouses/","src":[["https://cabinsatpinehaven.com/treehouses/","Cabins at Pine Haven: treehouses (official site)"]],"sub":"tree","loc":"census"}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-81.261959,37.319616]},"properties":{"id":"buffalo-trail-treehouses","n":"Rustic Treehouses at Buffalo Trail","k":"rail","town":"Bluefield","cty":"Mercer","why":"A village of 11 rustic treehouses (bring your own bedding) at an ATV resort about 5 miles from the Hatfield–McCoy Trails.","web":"https://buffalotrailcabins.com/accommodations/rustic-treehouses/","src":[["https://buffalotrailcabins.com/accommo